From 73638f65868bced1e544203d5fea25f071ecae46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 00:21:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] vibey-script: use canvas-dom-host for the shared DOM subset

Selectors, text, attributes, classList, inline and computed style, geometry,
listener metadata, timer ordering and the clock contract now come from
canvas-html's engine-neutral DOM host, shared with the Deno/V8 adapter.
Boa keeps its wrappers, callbacks and event objects.

Also: element.style and classList are cached per element, synthetic
Event/CustomEvent + dispatchEvent, microtasks drain after each timer,
timers cleared earlier in a batch do not run, performance.now() is the
exact (fractional) clock time and the epoch can be set.
---
